{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"so to clairify, its not jsut that (though that is a big part)... The Mender was a chinn.... and remembers directly how the natives felt about roanoke taking their lands.  He remembers his home becoming subjugated to the will of the aboleths.\n\nHis entire life he saw how easy it was for outsiders to brushoff his people in the name of what they feel is right and good.  He has seen people forced into bondage.  His worry is that something as easily manipulated as a group of people can on a whim do it again.  The fact that earlier you all said you didn't declare war, you declared independence, but are not writing in your document a way for others to declare their independence from you if they feel the oppression and corruption has gone too far to be worked out, jsut as you did with england, seems hypocritical, and shows that, in his mind, when push comes to shove, itll jsut be war again","created_at":"2021-08-13T13:11:19.030000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875728224775204876","reply_to_id":"875726019233992714","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"He is worried for more than jsut the people of this nation... he is worried about all people of every nation.  I have been careful to call it native nations, rather than call the people natives for a reason.  They already have their own forms of governments, their own laws.... they are unlikely to want to join and give up what they have.... just like real life.","created_at":"2021-08-13T13:15:08.553000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875729187464425472","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
